EXTENSION "ARM5e_Cov_Flaws" {
    NAME "Covenants - Flaws"
    VERSION "0.3"
    RELEASE_DATE "2026-03-05"
    DEPENDS_ON "ARM5e_Core_Character"
    # Source: Covenants

    #ARM5FS001aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Abyss" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab contains some kind of magical void, such as a bottomless well. This may be made into a Void Feature (purchased as usual). -2 Safety; +2 Pe."
    }

    #ARM5FS002aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Afire" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab, or large portions thereof, are engulfed in flames which never die out. This naturally requires some kind of protection or immunity to work in, and it means that whole categories of lab work (for example, research with Corpus, Animal, or Aquam) may be impossible. +1 Upkeep, -3 Safety, +2 Warping, +2 Aesthetics; +1 Experimentation, +3 Ig."
    }

    #ARM5FS003aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Chaotic" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab or its outfittings are in a constant state of flux or motion. -2 Safety, +1 Warping; +1 Experimentation, +2 Mu or Re."
    }

    #ARM5FS004aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Cursed" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION """The lab suffers from a supernatural curse. Any penalties to Characteristics (often Safety) as may be appropriate.
Moving a Laboratory

Relocating a lab to a new room (possibly in a different covenant altogether) is unfortunately a rather tiresome procedure. Firstly, the contents of the lab must be disassembled and carefully and laboriously packed into sturdy crates. This takes a season of work, although it may delegated to an apprentice, for example. Secondly, the crates must be transported to the new site. Unless aided or performed by magic, there will inevitably be some breakage in transit  --  the transport counts (and costs) as two entire years of maintenance. Finally, the crates must be unpacked and the lab reassembled. This takes two seasons, since it is basically the same as building a lab from scratch (except that the end result is the same as the previous lab, not a standard lab). Due to this time and expense, labs are rarely transported (at least not by mundane means). When moving between covenants (or even between rooms in the same covenant), some magi employ magic (such as The Ambulatory Laboratory, above) to move their labs, but most simply abandon their old labs or donate them to other magi. Building a new lab from scratch is an opportunity for a fresh start and a new design concept, perhaps taking advantage of a larger or otherwise superior chamber."""
    }

    #ARM5FS005aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Degenerative" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The equipment and ingredients of the lab decay and wear unnaturally quickly. +2 Upkeep, -1 Safety, +1 Warping, -2 Health, -1 Aesthetics; +2 Pe."
    }

    #ARM5FS006aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Gremlins" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is home to deliberately disruptive creatures, spirits, or demons. -3 Safety, +1 Warping, -1 Aesthetics; +1 Experimentation, 1 point on an appropriate Art Specialization."
    }

    #ARM5FS007aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Haunted" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is home to a haunting spirit, who occasionally disturbs the current owner. +1 Warping, -1 Aesthetics; +2 Me."
    }

    #ARM5FS008aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Impregnable" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is completely inaccessible, except through reasonably powerful magic. For example, it is blocked off by a stone wall and requires a Muto Terram spell to access. While the owner is much less likely to be disturbed, fewer people will ever get to see the lab, or they may assume that the owner is rather paranoid. -2 Aesthetics."
    }

    #ARM5FS009aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Inhabitants" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Residency in the lab is shared with other creatures who consider the place their home, not a lab. They may be a nuisance to the owner, and vice versa. -1 Safety, -1 Aesthetics; 1 point on an appropriate Art Specialization."
    }

    #ARM5FS010aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Labyrinth" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab, or at least its exterior portions, consists of some kind of maze or other structural puzzle. Most magi would find this tiresome and unnecessary, but some Criamon magi like to make their labs into labyrinths. -1 Safety, -1 Health, -2 Aesthetics; +2 Me or Vi."
    }

    #ARM5FS011aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Lair" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "A creature hides or hibernates in the lab, either known or unknown. -1 Safety, +1 Warping; 1 point on an appropriate Art Specialization."
    }

    #ARM5FS012aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Precarious" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION ": The lab is located in a supernaturally dangerous place, such as inside a volcano. This Virtue may be taken more than once, for greater degrees of danger. -1 Safety; 1 point on an appropriate Art Specialization.*"
    }

    #ARM5FS013aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"Predecessor" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Flaw"]
            ^"Size" ENUM ["Minor"]
            ^"Category" ENUM ["Supernatural"]
        }
